    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="8">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wi">Wi</ref> 8</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif man his mæn an wiofode freols gefe, se sie folcfry; freolsgefa age his erfe ænde wergild ⁊ munde þare hina, sie ofer mearce ðær he wille.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a person sets his man free at the altar, he shall have the rights of a free man of the people; the freedomgiver owns his inheritance and wergeld and protection of the kin, let him [the newly freed man] be over the border wherever he wishes.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif man his mæn an wiofode freols gefe, se sie folcfry; freolsgefa age his erfe ænde wergeld ⁊ munde þare hina, sie ofer mearce ðær he wille.</ab>
      </div>
